<section>
  <section id="test2">
    <h2>Is the language of each page correctly specified?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Press F12 to open dev tools in browser</li>
      <li>
        Find the <code is:raw> &lt;html&gt;</code> tag at the top of the source
        code.
      </li>
      <li>
        It must contain a lang attribute with the correct value (for example
        lang="fr" or lang="nl")
      </li>
      <li>
        Codes which indicate a region like "fr-be" or "en-US" are also valid see{' '}
        <a
          target="tweede"
          href="https://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry/language-subtag-registry">
          IANA registry{' '}
        </a>{' '}
        for full list
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="test2-inspection">
    <h2>Inspection of the HTML tag</h2>
    <p>
      <img
        src="https://images.anysurfer.be/language/girleek_lang_html.png"
        alt="html tag with lang=fr-BE attribute in devtools"
      />
    </p>
  </section>
  <section id="test3">
    <h2>Is the language of fragments of text correctly specified?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Only need to check for fragments of text that are in a different
        language than page
      </li>
      <li>Right click and inspect fragment that is in different language</li>
      <li>
        Does parent tag have a lang attribute that specifies the correct
        language?
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Example of English fragment in French page</h2>
    <p>
      <img
        src="https://images.anysurfer.be/language/girleek_lang_fragment.png"
        alt="sentence in english in website of Girleek (see code below)"
      />
    </p>
    <pre><code is:raw>&lt;span lang="en"&gt;Become the digital women of the future, now!&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre>
  </section>
</section>
